{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reya's Garden World Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A casual 2D clearance game featuring VTuber &quot;Reya Ostereich&quot; - a colossal dragon girl - and her companions in a miniature-scale adventure.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/0616c27b17da99fb37861fdefa052569.avif?t=1752983507\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Premise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The vile Goblin Legion has invaded a neighboring kingdom of the Austerich Dragon Empire, seizing its facilities. Now they\u2019re transforming human towns into military footholds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put a stop to their expansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Ostereich\u2019s giant dragon girl: harness your world-shattering power to stomp flat every annoying goblin and shatter occupied structures before they become tools of destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/864d58bc35d9627e4a6eaaf1cede7a0a.poster.avif?t=1752983507\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/864d58bc35d9627e4a6eaaf1cede7a0a.webm?t=1752983507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/864d58bc35d9627e4a6eaaf1cede7a0a.mp4?t=1752983507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exclusive Giantess Art Collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock 11 stunning illustrations showcasing the unique moe appeal of colossal maidens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternate Playable Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of other VTubers and freely crush &amp; trample your way through Garden World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for Giantess Enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/b76d093692e262760fe3b2cbbc829b5d.avif?t=1752983507\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880650?t=1752983507","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880650?t=1752983507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/4d99f176c601b6ceb7684b35c2d56e6872df41a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752983507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/4d99f176c601b6ceb7684b35c2d56e6872df41a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752983507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reya's Garden World Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A casual 2D clearance game featuring VTuber &quot;Reya Ostereich&quot; - a colossal dragon girl - and her companions in a miniature-scale adventure.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/0616c27b17da99fb37861fdefa052569.avif?t=1752983507\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Premise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The vile Goblin Legion has invaded a neighboring kingdom of the Austerich Dragon Empire, seizing its facilities. Now they\u2019re transforming human towns into military footholds!</p><